    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992510/extras/9d0a46d0345c9acf0e7542665b13e260.avif?t=1740933635\" width=600 height=65 /></span><br>Seven sinners awaken within the Moirae facility, where a mysterious figure informs them that the path to freedom will open only when they confess. Explore with escape room style puzzles, lead discussions, and uncover the secrets they desperately wish to hide in this branching path visual novel.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992510/extras/57c73910e99454987c2ac450962422df.poster.avif?t=1740933635\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992510/extras/57c73910e99454987c2ac450962422df.webm?t=1740933635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992510/extras/57c73910e99454987c2ac450962422df.mp4?t=1740933635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the facility:</h2></strong> Utilize Point &amp; Click gameplay to solve puzzles. Disassemble and combine items, enter passwords, and make a path forward.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992510/extras/71620f0dd8c744881fe9fbe5c4ed6f3d.poster.avif?t=1740933635\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992510/extras/71620f0dd8c744881fe9fbe5c4ed6f3d.webm?t=1740933635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992510/extras/71620f0dd8c744881fe9fbe5c4ed6f3d.mp4?t=1740933635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>